{"seq":1,"slug":"soft-label-kd","title":"软标签蒸馏","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/llm-distillation/methods/soft-label-kd","wordCount":1429,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"软标签蒸馏\">软标签蒸馏</h1><p>KL 散度不对称，这个高中数学里不起眼的性质，在生成模型蒸馏里造成了截然不同的两种学生行为：一种学生什么都想学一点、结果到处沾边却不精，另一种学生只学教师最确信的那部分、结果专一但漏掉长尾。前者是前向 KL，后者是反向 KL。软标签蒸馏的全部技术张力，几乎都围绕「该最小化哪个方向的 KL」展开。本篇是 hub 里 KL 目标函数的详述处，<a href=\"../foundations/teacher-student\">师生范式</a> 只锚定了标准形式，方向之争从这里开始。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>软标签蒸馏（soft-label / logit-based KD）的前提是：能在每个 token 位置拿到教师的<strong>完整概率分布</strong>。学生不模仿教师采出来的具体 token，而是直接拟合教师在整个词表上的分布。设教师分布 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>、学生分布 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span>，目标是让 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span> 逼近 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>。但「逼近」用哪个方向的 KL，决定了学生的性格。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    P[教师分布 p&lt;br/&gt;多模态] --&gt; FWD{选择 KL 方向}&#10;    Q[学生分布 q&lt;br/&gt;容量有限] --&gt; FWD&#10;    FWD --&gt;|前向 KL&lt;br/&gt;KL p 到 q| MEAN[mean-seeking&lt;br/&gt;覆盖所有模式&lt;br/&gt;过度平滑]&#10;    FWD --&gt;|反向 KL&lt;br/&gt;KL q 到 p| MODE[mode-seeking&lt;br/&gt;聚焦主模式&lt;br/&gt;更确定]&#10;    MEAN --&gt; G1[易产生&lt;br/&gt;低质量长尾输出]&#10;    MODE --&gt; G2[更适合&lt;br/&gt;生成任务]\">flowchart TD\n    P[教师分布 p&lt;br/&gt;多模态] --&gt; FWD{选择 KL 方向}\n    Q[学生分布 q&lt;br/&gt;容量有限] --&gt; FWD\n    FWD --&gt;|前向 KL&lt;br/&gt;KL p 到 q| MEAN[mean-seeking&lt;br/&gt;覆盖所有模式&lt;br/&gt;过度平滑]\n    FWD --&gt;|反向 KL&lt;br/&gt;KL q 到 p| MODE[mode-seeking&lt;br/&gt;聚焦主模式&lt;br/&gt;更确定]\n    MEAN --&gt; G1[易产生&lt;br/&gt;低质量长尾输出]\n    MODE --&gt; G2[更适合&lt;br/&gt;生成任务]</pre><p>下表对照两个方向的行为差异，是本篇的判据核心。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>前向 KL：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{KL}(p|q)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">KL</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></th>\n<th>反向 KL：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{KL}(q|p)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">KL</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>别名</td>\n<td>mean-seeking / 零避免</td>\n<td>mode-seeking / 零强制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 多模态而 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span> 容量不足</td>\n<td>摊平覆盖所有模式</td>\n<td>锁定一个主模式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>副作用</td>\n<td>过度平滑，给低质区域分概率</td>\n<td>可能丢失教师的多样性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适合</td>\n<td>分类、教师分布单峰</td>\n<td>开放生成、对话</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>需要采样</td>\n<td>否（可解析）</td>\n<td>是（学生自生成）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"前向-kl-经典但会过度平滑\">前向 KL：经典但会过度平滑</h2><p>经典蒸馏用的是前向 KL，即最小化 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{KL}(p \\| q) = \\sum_i p_i \\log(p_i / q_i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">KL</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0497em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。它是 mean-seeking 的：哪里教师有概率，学生就必须分一点概率过去，否则 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_i \\log(p_i/q_i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>→</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q_i \\to 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 时爆炸（「零避免」）。在分类里这没问题，教师分布通常单峰。但在 LLM 生成里，教师的下一 token 分布常常是多模态的（「这句话可以这样接，也可以那样接」），而学生容量有限装不下所有模式，前向 KL 逼它把概率摊薄到所有合理乃至不太合理的延续上，结果是<strong>过度平滑</strong>：学生采样时会以非零概率吐出教师其实很少选的低质 token。</p>\n<p>前向 KL 的优势是可解析、不需要学生自己采样，训练稳定高效。逐位置的损失就是 <a href=\"../foundations/teacher-student\">师生范式</a> 里给的那个对所有 token 求和的 KL。对许多任务它已经够用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"反向-kl-mode-seeking-更适合生成\">反向 KL：mode-seeking 更适合生成</h2><p>反向 KL 最小化 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{KL}(q \\| p) = \\sum_i q_i \\log(q_i / p_i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">KL</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0497em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，方向反过来：只在学生自己分配了概率的地方惩罚它偏离教师（「零强制」——学生没去的地方不管）。它是 mode-seeking 的，学生倾向锁定教师分布的一个主峰，不去硬覆盖所有模式。对开放式生成，这通常更好：宁可专一地学会教师最确信的回答方式，也不要为了覆盖而吐低质内容。</p>\n<p>代价是反向 KL 需要在<strong>学生自己生成的样本</strong>上计算（期望 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">E</mi><mi>q</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbb{E}_{q}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.975em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbb\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>），这把它和纯离线的前向 KL 区分开，引出了 on-policy 的味道。MiniLLM（2023）就是用反向 KL 做 LLM 蒸馏的代表，显著改善了生成质量。</p>\n<h2 id=\"gkd-把学生自生成样本拉进训练\">GKD：把学生自生成样本拉进训练</h2><p>前向 KL 在「教师轨迹」上训练，但学生推理时面对的是「自己生成的轨迹」，两者分布不一致——这是经典的曝光偏差/训练-推理不匹配。<strong>广义知识蒸馏</strong>（Generalized KD，GKD，2023）给出一个统一框架：训练数据混合教师轨迹与<strong>学生自生成轨迹</strong>，散度也可在前向 KL、反向 KL、以及两者插值的广义 Jensen-Shannon 之间选。在学生自生成样本上拿教师打分，本质就是 on-policy 蒸馏的雏形。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>G</mi><mi>K</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">E</mi><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>∼</mo><mtext>teacher</mtext></mrow></msub><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>λ</mi><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">E</mi><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>∼</mo><mtext>student</mtext></mrow></msub><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_{GKD} = (1-\\lambda)\\,\\mathbb{E}_{y\\sim \\text{teacher}}\\,[D(p\\|q)] + \\lambda\\,\\mathbb{E}_{y\\sim \\text{student}}\\,[D(p\\|q)]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">G</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbb\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∼</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">teacher</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mclose\">)]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbb\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∼</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">student</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mclose\">)]</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 是可选的散度，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 控制 on-policy 比例。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda=0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 退回纯离线前向 KL，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda=1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 全在学生轨迹上训。GKD 把 token 级软标签蒸馏推到了序列级的门口——真正的序列级目标见 <a href=\"sequence-level-kd\">序列级蒸馏</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"何时根本拿不到-logits\">何时根本拿不到 logits</h2><p>以上全部预设你能访问教师每个位置的完整分布。但许多最强的教师只开放 API、不返回 logits（或只返回 top-k），此时软标签蒸馏整个失效，必须退到只用教师生成的文本序列。这条「访问权限」的分界是 <a href=\"white-vs-black-box\">白盒与黑盒蒸馏</a> 的主题；序列级方法 <a href=\"sequence-level-kd\">序列级蒸馏</a> 正是为这种受限场景设计的。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>软标签蒸馏拟合教师的完整 token 分布，核心抉择是 KL 方向。</li>\n<li><strong>前向 KL</strong>（mean-seeking，零避免）覆盖所有模式但过度平滑，适合分类、可离线解析；<strong>反向 KL</strong>（mode-seeking，零强制）聚焦主模式、更适合生成，但需学生自采样。</li>\n<li><strong>GKD</strong> 把学生自生成轨迹混入训练并允许任选散度，缓解训练-推理不匹配，是迈向 on-policy 的桥梁。</li>\n<li>一切前提是能访问教师 logits；拿不到时退到序列级与黑盒方法。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"延伸阅读-跨链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨链接</h3><ul>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"../foundations/teacher-student\">师生范式</a> —— KL 蒸馏损失的标准形式与温度。</li>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"sequence-level-kd\">序列级蒸馏</a> —— GKD 之后真正的序列级目标。</li>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"white-vs-black-box\">白盒与黑盒蒸馏</a> —— 拿不到 logits 时怎么办。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../llm-fine-tuning/alignment-techniques/dpo\">LLM 微调 · DPO</a> —— 与反向 KL/偏好优化相通的训练思路。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../deep-learning/\">深度学习</a> —— KL 散度与 softmax 的基础。</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n<p>数据来源：MiniLLM（Gu et al., 2023, arxiv.org/abs/2306.08543）；GKD（Agarwal et al., 2023, arxiv.org/abs/2306.13649）；LLM 知识蒸馏综述（arxiv.org/pdf/2402.13116）。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"软标签蒸馏","id":"软标签蒸馏"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"前向 KL：经典但会过度平滑","id":"前向-kl-经典但会过度平滑"},{"level":2,"text":"反向 KL：mode-seeking 更适合生成","id":"反向-kl-mode-seeking-更适合生成"},{"level":2,"text":"GKD：把学生自生成样本拉进训练","id":"gkd-把学生自生成样本拉进训练"},{"level":2,"text":"何时根本拿不到 logits","id":"何时根本拿不到-logits"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":3,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨链接"}],"prev":{"title":"蒸馏与压缩边界","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/llm-distillation/foundations/distillation-vs-compression"},"next":{"title":"序列级蒸馏","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/llm-distillation/methods/sequence-level-kd"}}